{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u203b This game features a landmine-type romance experience filled with intense emotional manipulation and strong attachment, which may be uncomfortable for some players. Please proceed with caution.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/347a206e2d922b9a8fa7a18c3f2c3348.avif?t=1773230146\" width=370 height=514 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**\u3010<strong>Game Overview</strong>\u3011**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a genius engineer, find yourself living together with a Landmine Girl by chance. This lively and adorable girl quickly captures your attention. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your feelings grow, you become lovers, but soon realize that her love is heavy, even obsessive, like a mine ready to explode at any moment! Can you defuse the landmines in her heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/5ddc4553d5864ca371c2eede3c356d98.poster.avif?t=1773230146\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/5ddc4553d5864ca371c2eede3c356d98.webm?t=1773230146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/5ddc4553d5864ca371c2eede3c356d98.mp4?t=1773230146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**\u3010Game System\u3011**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---Classic Minesweeper Mini-Game---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a top-notch engineer, it makes perfect sense to put your &quot;mine sweeping&quot; skills to use anywhere you can. Whether it's coding work, cracking social media passwords, or even dating a Landmine Girl. Wherever there are mines, I'll sweep them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/cf7e61625391c109f17dba19e535b08e.poster.avif?t=1773230146\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/cf7e61625391c109f17dba19e535b08e.webm?t=1773230146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/cf7e61625391c109f17dba19e535b08e.mp4?t=1773230146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---Social Media Snooping for Intel---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering &quot;intel&quot; is key to winning a girl\u2019s heart. Spy on her social media accounts to glimpse her past, relationships, and daily life, and use that knowledge to push your romance forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/554f4d3caa69502657b26cb2ef74c4c4.poster.avif?t=1773230146\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/554f4d3caa69502657b26cb2ef74c4c4.webm?t=1773230146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/554f4d3caa69502657b26cb2ef74c4c4.mp4?t=1773230146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---Heart-Throbbing Co-Living---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making her smile is essential. Chat, give her gifts, go on da